{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Legend of red is a platform(3D) game where the main character tries to prove that he can become a legend,you will be able to visit 5 landsin search of pieces of the world's heart</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main character - RED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562360/extras/RED_S2.png?t=1741207504\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">his set of abilities\u00a0inqlude</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">basic movement like moving, jumping, wall jumping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">stomp - with half of your stamina you can force your way down and make impact when landing\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">spin - spinning allows you to fall slower\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stamina</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562360/extras/stamina_show.gif?t=1741207504\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is stamina in the game that powers your skills it regenerates when you don't use skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> in the air about 3% per second </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">on the floor about 20% per second </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">stomp uses -49% </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">spin - about 5% per second </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">dash - 45%</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562360?t=1741207504","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562360?t=1741207504","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562360/5dfe1250ef98232f1129628d754a4071c2e2dc3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741207504","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562360/5dfe1250ef98232f1129628d754a4071c2e2dc3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741207504","categories":[{"description":"Sing